# Project foundation

Turborepo monorepo (pnpm workspaces). Inspired by [darkroomengineering/satus](https://github.com/darkroomengineering/satus).

## Structure

```
apps/
  website/   @repo/website   Next.js 16 site (localhost:3000)
  studio/    @repo/studio    Sanity Studio (localhost:3333)

packages/
  cms/       @repo/cms       Portable Sanity layer (schemas, GROQ, client, live)
  ui/        @repo/ui        Cross-app UI primitives (Lenis smooth scroll)
  utilities/ @repo/utilities Shared helpers (cn)
  tsconfig/  @repo/tsconfig  TypeScript configs
```

Workspace names use **kebab-case**. Studio config (`sanity.config.ts`, plugins) lives in `apps/studio`. `@repo/cms` is only the portable data layer consumed by both apps.

## Imports

```ts
// Workspace packages — use subpath exports
import { cn } from '@repo/utilities/cn'
import { sanityFetch } from '@repo/cms'
import { SmoothScrollProvider } from '@repo/ui'

// App-local aliases (website)
import { ParallaxSection } from '@/components/effects/parallax-section'
```

## Commands (run from repo root)

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `pnpm dev` | website + studio |
| `pnpm lint` / `pnpm lint:fix` | Biome check across packages |
| `pnpm typecheck` | TypeScript via Turbo |
| `pnpm build` | Production build |
| `pnpm cms:typegen` | Regenerate Sanity types after schema changes |

## Tooling

- **Package manager:** pnpm 10 (never npm/yarn)
- **Lint/format:** Biome (single quotes, semicolons as needed, sorted Tailwind classes)
- **Commits:** Conventional Commits via commitlint + Husky
- **CI target:** lint, typecheck, build must pass before merge
